sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant PositionsService as Positions Service
    participant PnLService as P&L Calculation Service
    participant MarginService as Margin Service
    participant ClickHouse as ClickHouse
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,DB: Open Position Flow

    User->>Frontend: Click Buy/Sell<br/>Enter Lot Size, TP, SL
    Frontend->>API: POST /positions<br/>{ session_id, direction, lots, tp, sl }
    
    API->>PositionsService: createPosition(data)
    
    PositionsService->>ClickHouse: Get Current Price<br/>Latest Candle Close
    ClickHouse-->>PositionsService: Current Price
    
    PositionsService->>PositionsService: Calculate Entry Price<br/>Apply Spread & Slippage
    
    PositionsService->>MarginService: checkMarginRequirement(session, position)
    MarginService->>MarginService: Calculate Required Margin<br/>lots * contract_size / leverage
    MarginService-->>PositionsService: Margin Required
    
    PositionsService->>MarginService: calculateAvailableMargin(session)
    MarginService-->>PositionsService: Available Margin
    
    alt Insufficient Margin
        PositionsService-->>API: Error: Insufficient Margin
        API-->>Frontend: 400 Bad Request
    else Sufficient Margin
        PositionsService->>DB: Create Position Record
        DB-->>PositionsService: Position Created
        
        PositionsService->>PnLService: calculateUnrealizedPnL(position, currentPrice)
        PnLService-->>PositionsService: Unrealized P&L
        
        PositionsService->>DB: Create Transaction Record
        DB-->>PositionsService: Transaction Created
        
        PositionsService-->>API: Position Created
        API-->>Frontend: 201 Created + Position
        Frontend-->>User: Position Opened Successfully
    end

    Note over User,DB: Close Position Flow

    User->>Frontend: Click Close Position
    Frontend->>API: PATCH /positions/:id/close
    
    API->>PositionsService: closePosition(positionId)
    
    PositionsService->>ClickHouse: Get Current Price
    ClickHouse-->>PositionsService: Current Price
    
    PositionsService->>PnLService: calculateRealizedPnL(position, exitPrice)
    PnLService-->>PositionsService: Realized P&L
    
    PositionsService->>DB: Update Position<br/>status: CLOSED, exit_price, closed_at
    PositionsService->>DB: Update Session<br/>current_balance += realized_pnl
    PositionsService->>DB: Create Transaction Record
    
    PositionsService-->>API: Position Closed
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK + Updated Position
    Frontend-->>User: Position Closed

    Note over User,DB: Update TP/SL Flow

    User->>Frontend: Update TP/SL Values
    Frontend->>API: PATCH /positions/:id<br/>{ take_profit, stop_loss }
    
    API->>PositionsService: updatePosition(id, { tp, sl })
    PositionsService->>DB: Update Position<br/>take_profit, stop_loss
    DB-->>PositionsService: Updated Position
    PositionsService-->>API: Updated Position
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK + Position
    Frontend-->>User: TP/SL Updated
